    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Bardhaman | Safe Car Carrier Services WB-39
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure my car remains scratch‑free during transportation from Bardhaman?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each vehicle is loaded onto a hydraulic ramp and secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings inside an enclosed, multi‑axle trailer. The interior is lined with 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, including foam edge protectors and bubble wrap, guaranteeing zero‑scratch transit for every car moving service.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book car transportation in Bardhaman?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID, a copy of the insurance policy (if any), and the destination address proof. Our team also prepares an IBA‑approved GST invoice, which is accepted for corporate and government reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the 850 km journey from Bardhaman to major transport hubs typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit time averages 12‑14 hours, depending on traffic and weather conditions along the National Highway corridors. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress, and our dedicated support team provides updates at key milestones to keep you informed throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What does the full‑coverage transit insurance cover for my vehicle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our IRDAI‑approved insurance provides 100 % declared‑value coverage against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural disasters during transit. In the unlikely event of a claim, the settlement process is swift, and the insurance cost is included in the transparent pricing breakdown.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car live while it is being transported?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every trailer is equipped with a satellite GPS unit that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive instant alerts at departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival, ensuring complete visibility of your car transportation in Bardhaman.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or weight restrictions for transporting SUVs or luxury cars?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet includes 18‑ft, 22‑ft, and 32‑ft MX container trucks with hydraulic ramps designed to handle vehicles up to 3.5 tons. SUVs, premium sedans, and luxury cars are all accommodated with custom wooden crates and padded supports to ensure safe handling.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost for car transportation calculated and is there any hidden fee?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on distance (850 km), vehicle type, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any special handling requirements. The quote you receive is itemized with no hidden fees, and the IBA‑approved GST bill ensures transparent, claim‑ready invoicing for corporate or personal moves.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
